\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. God of all-redeeming grace,
\par By Thy pardoning love compelled,
\par Up to Thee our souls we raise,
\par Up to Thee our bodies yield:
\par Thou our sacrifice receive,
\par Acceptable through Thy  Son,
\par While to Thee alone we live,
\par While we die to Thee alone.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Meet it is, and just, and right,
\par That we should be wholly Thine,
\par In Thine only will delight,
\par In Thy blessed service join:
\par O that every work and word
\par Might proclaim how good Thou art,
\par Holiness unto the Lord
\par Still be written on our heart!
\par Amen.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

